 "mechanisms": {
  "SHEER_COLD idle x2": "Move_SHEER_COLD runs no task that writes x2/y2 (fadetobg / FrozenIceCube / Task_UpdateMonBg reads x + x2); the renderer drew both battlers and the monbg copy with x2 = 0. Fix: config.idleRest = the tracked frontIdleRest of both battlers (liveMoveAnimation.ts case 329), drawn by the SHEER_COLD branch.",
  "SAND_TOMB idle x2": "Move_SAND_TOMB shakes only the target (target initialX2 was already modelled); the attacker was drawn without its rest. Fix: config.attackerIdleRest (case 328) drawn by the SAND_TOMB branch.",
  "SKY_ATTACK charge idle x2": "AnimTask_HorizontalShake (battle_anim_ground.c:666-705): AnimTask_ShakeBattlers makes no write on its first frame (tDelay 1) and case 2 sets x2 = 0 before destroying itself. The reducer wrote 0 at age 43 and restored the input x2 after age 106 (attacker rows 45, 109-147 with the 2-row display lag). Fix: src/animation/skyAttack.ts battlersAtAge shake from age 44, x2 = 0 after age 106 (identical for zero-rest inputs). Target: the charge monbg copy (Task_UpdateMonBg x + x2, ages 1-128) was drawn at x; now at x + targetSprite.x2.",
  "SHEER_COLD elevated shadow": "ISSUES #142 SpriteCB_EnemyShadow: the elevated opponent shadow is visible on the activation frame; Sheer Cold had no shadow row. activation == window start for the FLYGON / GOLBAT swaps (derive.txt: player 75/75, opponent 78/78) -> LIVE_MOVE_OPPONENT_SHADOW_ROW[329] = 0; issue142-shadow-rows-extra.json 329 rows now inWindow with shadowRow 0."
 },
